    {"id":"highly-accelerated-temperature-humidity-stress-test","term":"Highly Accelerated Temperature and Humidity Stress Test","term_zh":"高加速温湿度应力试验","aliases":["HAST"],"definition_zh":"以严苛温度、湿度和偏置条件加速非气密封装潮气渗透失效的试验。","category":"Reliability & Failure"}
